# API module boundaries

Modules under `apps/api/src/modules/*` own their tables via their services only.

- Sales/POS → call `inventoryService` for stock; never write inventory tables directly
- Purchasing → stock via inventory movements on receive
- Catalog → product/variant/price data only; stock balances are inventory
- Integrations → outbox/events; do not block checkout on external HTTP
- Fiscal → `FiscalProvider`; allow `FISCAL_PENDING` + worker retry

Shared DTOs live in `packages/contracts/<domain>`. Schema in `packages/database` — propose migrations, do not silently reshape unrelated entities.
